ike the device Apple is willing to refresh.\nDigiTimes' report mentions that the new machine's panel, manufactured by LG, should come in at 13.3 inches, which is in line with the current MacBook Air's — except for its resolution, billed at 2,560x1,600, which would effectively bring it up to Retina levels.\nThe company is reportedly expecting to ship 6 million units of the new MacBook by the end of the year, although analysts have set on a more conservative 4 million.\nThe upcoming MacBook Air, which might be unveiled at Apple's WWDC conference early in June, should hit the market later in Q3 this year, at a starting price that hovers around $900 (£650).\nNOW WATCH: How compression pants work and why they are so popular", "external_links": ["http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~4/9oZYrDbBwZM", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=9oZYrDbBwZM:gy4-V_i1Dfo:V_sGLiPBpWU", "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20180312VL201.html", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=7Q72WNTAKBA", "http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider/~3/9oZYrDbBwZM/apple-new-entry-level-macbook-air-retina-display-2018-3", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=9oZYrDbBwZM:gy4-V_i1Dfo:qj6IDK7rITs", "https://www.macrumors.com/2018/03/12/new-entry-level-mac-notebook-retina/", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=QXVau8BzmBE", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=cGdyc7Q-1BI", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=9oZYrDbBwZM:gy4-V_i1Dfo:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=9oZYrDbBwZM:gy4-V_i1Dfo:cGdyc7Q-1BI", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyi